Package: com.yourid.dshpet
Name: dsh-pet
Version: 0.0.1
Section: Tweaks
Priority: optional
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.7100) | ellekit
Maintainer: YourID <you@example.com>
Author: YourID
Description: Floating desktop pet for SpringBoard (rootless)
 dsh-pet renders an animated, draggable, tappable floating pet on the
 iOS home screen inside SpringBoard. First release: transparent
 passthrough overlay window, sequence-frame animation, drag with
 spring-back and screen clamping, and 5-way tap response animations.
 Rootless (/var/jb) build.
